{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51950","headline":"集虚观留题（在岳池县郭南门外。○又作《寓云洞桥夜题石壁》） · 吕岩","name":"集虚观留题（在岳池县郭南门外。○又作《寓云洞桥夜题石壁》）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青蛇炼影月（一作「就自」）徘徊，夜静云间尚未（一作「开向此」）来。\n应是有人新换骨，暂留踪迹到天台。\n（《舆地纪胜》一六五《广安军·仙释》。\n《古今图书集成·职方典》六○二《顺庆府部》。\n又一二七○《辰州府部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51950.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51950","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}